> setblock 20 -60 -24 quark:monster_box
> tp qa 18 -60 -24
sleep 5
> execute if block 20 -60 -24 quark:monster_box
expect Test failed
> execute positioned 20 -60 -24 run kill @e[type=!minecraft:player,distance=..24]

## CQ-MB-08 | monster box: standing warning, sneak break, no flames in cooldown (MT-48, MT-49)
@group client
@commands MT-48, MT-49 by hand: diamond pickaxe standing (warning, box back), sneaking (breaks, no drop); flames gone in cooldown
@pass as MT-48, MT-49
@fails break guard or client phase sync
@from batches/r1101/c1_client.qb
> tp @s 8 -55 -22 180 20
sleep 3
> setblock 8 -60 -30 quark:monster_box
> tp @s 6 -60 -30 -90 20
shot box
look hand: diamond pickaxe standing -> warning, box back; sneaking -> breaks, no drop; WTHIT hardness 25 (changelog) vs the queue's 50; flames gone while it rests (SQ-MB phase 2)
